INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('kissMyApps-tlm/kissmychat/hotkey', 'hotkey', 'kissMyApps-tlm', 'kissmychat', 'community', 'hotkey kissMyApps-tlm kissmychat community The hotkey skill allows developers to add new keyboard shortcuts by updating the HotkeyEnum constant and registering default hotkeys. This benefits AI agent developers who need to customize keyboard interactions. 本文介绍如何在代码中添加自定义热键，包括更新热键常量和注册默认热键 この記事では、コードにカスタムホットキーを追加する方法を説明します。ホットキーコンスタントの更新とデフォルトホットキーの登録を含みます 이 문서는 코드에서 사용자 정의 핫키를 추가하는 방법을 설명합니다. 핫키 상수 업데이트 및 기본 핫키 등록 포함 El skill hotkey permite agregar atajos de teclado personalizados con TypeScript. Actualiza la constante HotkeyEnum y registra la tecla por defecto. Le skill hotkey permet d''ajouter des raccourcis clavier personnalisés avec TypeScript. Mettre à jour la constante HotkeyEnum et enregistrer la touche par défaut. Der Skill hotkey ermöglicht die Hinzufügung benutzerdefinierter Tastenkombinationen mit TypeScript. Aktualisieren Sie die Konstante HotkeyEnum und registrieren Sie die Standardtaste. O hotkey permite adicionar atalhos de teclado personalizados ao seu aplicativo. Atualize as constantes e registre os atalhos padrão para melhorar a experiência do usuário. Hotkey позволяет добавлять пользовательские горячие клавиши в ваше приложение. Обновите константы и зарегистрируйте стандартные горячие клавиши, чтобы улучшить опыт пользователя ИИ Агенты. الهوتكاي يسمح بإضافة اختصارات لوحة مفاتيح مخصصة إلى تطبيقك. قم بتحديث الثوابت وتسجيل الاختصارات الافتراضية لتحسين تجربة المستخدم how to use hotkey in AI agents hotkey setup guide hotkey vs keyboard shortcut hotkey installation for AI agents what is hotkey in AI development hotkey alternative for custom keyboard interactions hotkey implementation in TypeScript hotkey registration process hotkey constant update 热键设置 添加自定义热键 TypeScript KeyMapEnum combineKeys 代码优化 热键注册 AIエージェント 热键常量更新 Updates HotkeyEnum constant in src/types/hotkey.ts to add new hotkeys Registers default hotkeys using the HOTKEYS_REGISTRATION array in src/const/hotkeys.ts Utilizes the combineKeys function from @lobehub/ui to define hotkey combinations Supports hotkey groups, such as HotkeyGroupEnum.Conversation, for organized registration Exports HotkeyRegistration type for custom hotkey definitions Integrates with TypeScript for typed hotkey constants and registrations hotkey is a feature that enables developers to assign custom keyboard shortcuts to specific actions in AI agents, using constants and registrations defined in TypeScript files.');
