INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('tarrragon/ccsession/security-review', 'security-review', 'tarrragon', 'ccsession', 'community', 'security-review tarrragon ccsession community The security-review skill provides a comprehensive security audit guide for Flutter/Dart projects, helping developers identify and fix vulnerabilities. It benefits developers working with sensitive user data and APIs. Security Review Skill 提供 Flutter/Dart 项目的安全审查快速指引，帮助开发者确保代码安全 Security Review スキルは Flutter/Dart プロジェクトのセキュリティチェックの迅速なガイドを提供し、開発者がコードの安全性を確保するのに役立ちます 보안 리뷰 스킬은 Flutter/Dart 프로젝트의 보안 검토를 위한 빠른 가이드를 제공하여 개발자가 코드의 안전성을 보장할 수 있습니다 La revisión de seguridad es crucial para proteger tus proyectos Flutter/Dart. Nuestra guía cubre el manejo de secretos, autenticación y más La revue de sécurité est essentielle pour protéger vos projets Flutter/Dart. Notre guide couvre la gestion des secrets, l''authentification et plus Die Sicherheitsprüfung ist entscheidend, um Ihre Flutter/Dart-Projekte zu schützen. Unser Leitfaden behandelt Geheimnisverwaltung, Authentifizierung und mehr A revisão de segurança para Flutter/Dart ajuda a proteger aplicativos contra vulnerabilidades. Veja como configurar a segurança corretamente. Безопасность для Flutter/Dart помогает защитить приложения от уязвимостей. Узнайте, как настроить безопасность правильно. مراقبة الأمن ل Flutter/Dart تساعد على حماية التطبيقات من نقاط الضعف. تعرف على كيفية إعداد الأمن بشكل صحيح. how to use security-review security-review for Flutter secure Dart projects security-review setup guide security-review vs OWASP security-review install what is security-review security-review best practices security-review for API security Security Review Flutter 安全审查 Dart 安全审查 机密管理 安全检查清单 核心原则 Dart 安全开发 Flutter 安全开发 API 安全 代码安全 Provides a security checklist for Flutter/Dart projects Supports secure credential management using --dart-define or .env files Ensures sensitive files like .env and google-services.json are ignored by git Helps manage device permissions for camera and storage Guides secure API key and token handling security-review is a skill that provides a set of security principles and checks to ensure Flutter/Dart projects are secure, including machine credential management and secure API integration');
