für Mac Mini M4, das die Interaktion mit Obsidian-Instanzen ermöglicht","pt":"O que é Obsidian-CLI? É uma ferramenta de linha de comando para automação de tarefas e backups de configuração do Obsidian.","ru":"Что такое Obsidian-CLI? Это командная строка для автоматизации задач и резервного копирования конфигураций Obsidian.","ar":"ما هو Obsidian-CLI؟ هو أداة سطر أوامر لتحسين أداء تلقائي للمهام وتخزين نسخة احتياطية من إعدادات Obsidian."},"features":{"en":["Run `obsidian help` to access the full list of available commands","Use parameters with `=` and quote values with spaces for precise control","Utilize flags as boolean switches with no value for flexible automation","Create new notes with `obsidian create` and specify name and content","Access full documentation at https://help.obsidian.md/cli for advanced usage"],"zh":["支持命令行交互","提供配置备份功能","支持 Mac Mini M4","使用 `obsidian help` 命令查看所有可用命令","支持参数和标志","使用 `obsidian create` 命令创建新笔记"],"ja":["コマンドラインでの対話をサポート","設定バックアップ機能を提供","Mac Mini M4 をサポート","`obsidian help` コマンドで利用可能なすべてのコマンドを表示","パラメータとフラグをサポート","`obsidian create` コマンドで新しいノートを作成"],"ko":["명령줄 상호 작용 지원","설정 백업 기능 제공","Mac Mini M4 지원","`obsidian help` 명령으로 모든 사용 가능한 명령 보기","매개변수와 플래그 지원","`obsidian create` 명령으로 새 노트 생성"],"es":["Parámetros con valores asignados mediante el símbolo =","Bandera silenciosa para operaciones sin retroalimentación","Soporte para sobrescritura de notas existentes","Comando de ayuda integrado para ver todas las opciones disponibles","Compatibilidad con Mac Mini M4"],"fr":["Paramètres avec des valeurs attribuées à l''aide du symbole =","Drapeau silencieux pour les opérations sans rétroaction","Prise en charge de la réécriture de notes existantes","Commande d''aide intégrée pour afficher toutes les options disponibles","Compatibilité avec Mac Mini M4"],"de":["Parameter mit Werten, die über das =-Zeichen zugewiesen werden","Stiller Modus für Operationen ohne Rückmeldung","Unterstützung für die Überschreibung von bestehenden Notizen","Integrierte Hilfefunktion, um alle verfügbaren Optionen anzuzeigen","Kompatibilität mit Mac Mini M4"],"pt":["Parâmetros com valores atribuídos por ''=''","Flags booleanos sem valor","Criação de notas com comando ''create''","Suporte a valores com espaços com aspas","Comando ''help'' para visualizar comandos disponíveis"],"ru":["Параметры с значениями, присвоенными с помощью ''=''","Булевые флаги без значения","Создание заметок с помощью команды ''create''","Поддержка значений с пробелами в кавычках","Команда ''help'' для просмотра доступных команд"],"ar":["معلمات بقيم مخصصة بواسطة ''=''","أعلام منطقية بدون قيمة","إنشاء ملاحظات باستخدام الأمر ''create''","دعم القيم مع المسافات بين الاقتباسات","الأمر ''help'' لعرض الأوامر المتاحة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use obsidian-cli","obsidian-cli setup guide","obsidian-cli alternative","obsidian-cli vs other automation tools","obsidian-cli install","what is obsidian-cli","obsidian-cli command reference","obsidian-cli automation examples"],"zh":["Obsidian CLI","AI 工具","命令行工具","配置备份","Mac Mini M4","Obsidian","开发效率","命令行交互"],"ja":["Obsidian CLI","AI エージェント","コマンドラインツール","設定バックアップ","Mac Mini M4","Obsidian","開発効率","コマンドラインでの対話"],"ko":["Obsidian CLI","AI 에이전트","명령줄 도구","설정 백업","Mac Mini M4","Obsidian","개발 효율","명령줄 상호 작용"],"es":["obsidian cli","herramientas de automatización de ia","mac mini m4","línea de comandos","automatización de tareas","configuración de obsidian","herramientas de desarrollo","integración con ia"],"fr":["obsidian cli","outils d''automatisation d''ia","mac mini m4","ligne de commande","automatisation de tâches","configuration d''obsidian","outils de développement","intégration avec ia"],"de":["obsidian cli","ia-automatisierungstools","mac mini m4","kommandozeile","automatisierung von aufgaben","konfiguration von obsidian","entwicklerwerkzeuge","integration mit ia"],"pt":["Obsidian-CLI","ferramentas de automação de IA","Mac Mini M4","backups de configuração","linha de comando","parâmetros","flags booleanos","comando create"],"ru":["Obsidian-CLI","ИИ Агенты","Mac Mini M4","резервное копирование конфигураций","командная строка","параметры","булевы флаги","команда create"],"ar":["Obsidian-CLI","أدوات تلقائية ذكية","ماك ميني M4","نسخ احتياطي من الإعدادات","سطر الأوامر","معلمات","أعلام منطقية","الأمر create"]}},"owner":"mywaffles","repo":"ai-backup-mac","repoPath":"mywaffles/ai-backup-mac","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T06:18:15Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"obsidian-cli","description":"Interact with Obsidian vaults using the Obsidian CLI to read, create, search, and manage notes, tasks, properties, and more. Also supports plugin and theme development with commands to reload plugins, run JavaScript, capture errors, take screenshots, and inspect the DOM. Use when the user asks to interact with their Obsidian vault, manage notes, search vault content, perform vault operations from the command line, or develop and debug Obsidian plugins and themes.","bodyPreview":"# Obsidian CLI\n\nUse the `obsidian` CLI to interact with a running Obsidian instance. Requires Obsidian to be open.\n\n## Command reference\n\nRun `obsidian help` to see all available commands. This is always up to date. Full docs: https://help.obsidian.md/cli\n\n## Syntax\n\n**Parameters** take a value with `=`. Quote values with spaces:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"\n```\n\n**Flags** are boolean switches with no value:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" silent overwrit","body":"# Obsidian CLI\n\nUse the `obsidian` CLI to interact with a running Obsidian instance. Requires Obsidian to be open.\n\n## Command reference\n\nRun `obsidian help` to see all available commands. This is always up to date. Full docs: https://help.obsidian.md/cli\n\n## Syntax\n\n**Parameters** take a value with `=`. Quote values with spaces:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"\n```\n\n**Flags** are boolean switches with no value:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" silent overwrite\n```\n\nFor multiline content use `\\n` for newline and `\\t` for tab.\n\n## File targeting\n\nMany commands accept `file` or `path` to target a file. Without either, the active file is used.\n\n- `file=<name>` — resolves like a wikilink (name only, no path or extension needed)\n- `path=<path>` — exact path from vault root, e.g. `folder/note.md`\n\n## Vault targeting\n\nCommands target the most recently focused vault by default. Use `vault=<name>` as the first parameter to target a specific vault:\n\n```bash\nobsidian vault=\"My Vault\" search query=\"test\"\n```\n\n## Common patterns\n\n```bash\nobsidian read file=\"My Note\"\nobsidian create name=\"New Note\" content=\"# Hello\" template=\"Template\" silent\nobsidian append file=\"My Note\" content=\"New line\"\nobsidian search query=\"search term\" limit=10\nobsidian daily:read\nobsidian daily:append content=\"- [ ] New task\"\nobsidian property:set name=\"status\" value=\"done\" file=\"My Note\"\nobsidian tasks daily todo\nobsidian tags sort=count counts\nobsidian backlinks file=\"My Note\"\n```\n\nUse `--copy` on any command to copy output to clipboard. Use `silent` to prevent files from opening. Use `total` on list commands to get a count.\n\n## Plugin development\n\n### Develop/test cycle\n\nAfter making code changes to a plugin or theme, follow this workflow:\n\n1. **Reload** the plugin to pick up changes:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian plugin:reload id=my-plugin\n   ```\n2. **Check for errors** — if errors appear, fix and repeat from step 1:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian dev:errors\n   ```\n3. **Verify visually** with a screenshot or DOM inspection:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian dev:screenshot path=screenshot.png\n   obsidian dev:dom selector=\".workspace-leaf\" text\n   ```\n4. **Check console output** for warnings or unexpected logs:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian dev:console level=error\n   ```\n\n### Additional developer commands\n\nRun JavaScript in the app context:\n\n```bash\nobsidian eval code=\"app.vault.getFiles().length\"\n```\n\nInspect CSS values:\n\n```bash\nobsidian dev:css selector=\".workspace-leaf\" prop=background-color\n```\n\nToggle mobile emulation:\n\n```bash\nobsidian dev:mobile on\n```\n\nRun `obsidian help` to see additional developer commands including CDP and debugger controls.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T13:10:18.149Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automation Agents requiring command-line interaction with Obsidian instances for note management and automation.","zh":"适用于需要与 Obsidian 实例进行命令行交互以进行笔记管理和自动化的自动化代理。","ja":"Obsidian インスタンスとのコマンドラインでのやりとりが必要な自動化エージェントに最適。","ko":"Obsidian 인스턴스와 명령줄 상호 작용이 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización que requieren interacción con línea de comandos con instancias de Obsidian para la gestión y automatización de notas.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Automatisation nécessitant une interaction en ligne de commande avec des instances Obsidian pour la gestion et l''automatisation de notes.","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungsagenten, die eine Kommandozeileninteraktion mit Obsidian-Instanzen für die Notizenverwaltung und -automatisierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação que exigem interação de linha de comando com instâncias do Obsidian para gerenciamento e automação de notas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, требующих взаимодействия с экземплярами Obsidian через командную строку для управления заметками и автоматизации.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين الذين يتطلبون التفاعل سطر الأوامر مع مثيلات Obsidian لإدارة الملاحظات والتحكم الآلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage notes in Obsidian using the `obsidian` CLI, supporting parameters and flags for customized interactions, such as creating notes with specific names and content using `obsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"`.","zh":"使代理能够使用 `obsidian` CLI 在 Obsidian 中创建和管理笔记，支持参数和标志以实现自定义交互，例如使用 `obsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"` 创建具有特定名称和内容的笔记。","ja":"エージェントが `obsidian` CLI を使用して Obsidian でノートを作成および管理できるようにし、パラメータやフラグをサポートしてカスタマイズされたやりとりを実現できる。たとえば、`obsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"` を使用して特定の名前と内容を持つノートを作成する。","ko":"에이전트가 `obsidian` CLI를 사용하여 Obsidian에서 노트를 생성하고 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 사용자 지정 상호 작용을 위한 매개 변수 및 플래그를 지원합니다. 예를 들어, `obsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"`를 사용하여 특정 이름 및 내용을 가진 노트를 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar notas en Obsidian utilizando el `obsidian` CLI, que admite parámetros y banderas para interacciones personalizadas, como crear notas con nombres y contenido específicos utilizando `obsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des notes dans Obsidian en utilisant le `obsidian` CLI, qui prend en charge les paramètres et les drapeaux pour des interactions personnalisées, telles que la création de notes avec des noms et un contenu spécifiques en utilisant `obsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Notizen in Obsidian zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem sie das `obsidian` CLI verwenden, das Parameter und Flaggen für benutzerdefinierte Interaktionen unterstützt, wie z. B. das Erstellen von Notizen mit bestimmten Namen und Inhalten mithilfe von `obsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"`.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar notas no Obsidian usando o `obsidian` CLI, suportando parâmetros e flags para interações personalizadas, como criar notas com nomes e conteúdo específicos usando `obsidian create name=\"Minha Nota\" content=\"Olá mundo\"`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и управлять заметками в Obsidian с помощью `obsidian` CLI, поддерживая параметры и флаги для настраиваемых взаимодействий, таких как создание заметок с конкретными именами и содержимым с помощью `obsidian create name=\"Моя Заметка\" content=\"Привет мир\"`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إنشاء وإدارة الملاحظات في Obsidian باستخدام `obsidian` CLI ، مع دعم المعلمات والرايات للتفاعلات المخصصة ، مثل إنشاء ملاحظات بأسماء ومحتوى محددين باستخدام `obsidian create name=\"ملاحظتي\" content=\"مرحبا بالعالم\"`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating note creation with predefined content","Managing existing notes via the command line","Integrating Obsidian with other tools for workflow automation"],"zh":["使用预定义内容自动创建笔记","通过命令行管理现有笔记","将 Obsidian 与其他工具集成以实现工作流自动化"],"ja":["事前定義されたコンテンツを使用してノートを作成する自動化","コマンドラインを使用して既存のノートを管理する","Obsidian を他のツールと統合してワークフロー自動化を実現する"],"ko":["사전 정의된 내용으로 자동으로 노트를 생성하는 것","명령줄을 통해 기존 노트를 관리하는 것","Obsidian을 다른 도구와 통합하여 워크플로 자동화를 구현하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de notas con contenido predefinido","Gestión de notas existentes a través de la línea de comandos","Integración de Obsidian con otras herramientas para la automatización de flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de notes avec un contenu prédéfini","Gestion de notes existantes via la ligne de commande","Intégration d''Obsidian avec d''autres outils pour l''automatisation de flux de travail"],"de":["Automatisierung der Notizenerstellung mit vordefiniertem Inhalt","Verwaltung bestehender Notizen über die Kommandozeile","Integration von Obsidian mit anderen Tools für die Automatisierung von Arbeitsabläufen"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de notas com conteúdo predefinido","Gerenciar notas existentes via linha de comando","Integrar o Obsidian com outras ferramentas para automação de fluxo de trabalho"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание заметок с предопределенным содержимым","Управлять существующими заметками через командную строку","Интегрировать Obsidian с другими инструментами для автоматизации рабочего процесса"],"ar":["تتمة إنشاء الملاحظات بمحتوى محدد مسبقا","إدارة الملاحظات الحالية من خلال سطر الأوامر","دمج Obsidian مع أدوات أخرى للتحكم الآلي في سير العمل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Obsidian to be open and running","Limited to command-line interactions"],"zh":["需要 Obsidian 已经打开并运行","仅限命令行交互"],"ja":["Obsidian が既に開かれ、実行されている必要がある","コマンドラインでのやりとりに限定される"],"ko":["Obsidian이 이미 열려 있고 실행 중인 경우에만 사용할 수 있습니다.","명령줄 상호 작용에만 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere que Obsidian esté abierto y en ejecución","Limitado a interacciones con la línea de comandos"],"fr":["Nécessite que Obsidian soit ouvert et en cours d''exécution","Limité aux interactions en ligne de commande"],"de":["Erfordert, dass Obsidian geöffnet und ausgeführt wird","Begrenzt auf Kommandozeileninteraktionen"],"pt":["Exige que o Obsidian esteja aberto e em execução","Limitado a interações de linha de comando"],"ru":["Требует, чтобы Obsidian был открыт и запущен","Ограничен взаимодействиями через командную строку"],"ar":["يتطلب أن يكون Obsidian مفتوحا ويعمل","محدود بالتفاعلات سطر الأوامر"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"b54257cdc0e5d04488b35b0c797bfe427b24359f0848d3c73924dcacf8da6358","qualityScore":36}');
