upertest","ko":"테스팅 패턴 설정 가이드 - Jest + Supertest","es":"Patrones de Pruebas: Guía de Configuración con Jest y Sup...","fr":"Modèles de Tests: Guide d''Installation avec Jest et Super...","de":"Testmuster: Einrichtungsleitfaden mit Jest und Supertest","pt":"Padrões de Teste: Guia de Configuração com Jest e Supertest","ru":"Шаблоны тестирования: Руководство по настройке с Jest и S...","ar":"نماذج الاختبار: دليل الإعداد مع Jest و Supertest لأدوات ا..."},"description":{"en":"Discover how to implement efficient testing patterns with Jest and Supertest for your Node.js backend, and take your testing to the next level - learn more now!","zh":"了解测试模式的最佳实践，使用Jest + Supertest设置后端测试环境，提高代码质量","ja":"テスティングパターンのベストプラクティスを学び、Jest + Supertestを使用してバックエンドのテスト環境を設定する","ko":"테스팅 패턴의 베스트 프랙티스를 학습하고 Jest + Supertest를 사용하여 백엔드 테스트 환경을 설정합니다","es":"Aprende a implementar patrones de pruebas efectivos con Jest y Supertest en tu proyecto Node.js/TypeScript","fr":"Découvrez comment mettre en œuvre des modèles de tests efficaces avec Jest et Supertest dans votre projet Node.js/TypeScript","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie effektive Testmuster mit Jest und Supertest in Ihrem Node.js/TypeScript-Projekt implementieren","pt":"Aprenda a configurar padrões de teste eficazes com Jest e Supertest para melhorar a qualidade do seu código Node.js/TypeScript","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить эффективные шаблоны тестирования с помощью Jest и Supertest для улучшения качества вашего кода Node.js/TypeScript для ИИ Агентов","ar":"تعرف على كيفية تكوين نماذج اختبار فعالة مع Jest و Supertest لتحسين جودة رمز Node.js/TypeScript لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"definition":{"en":"testing-patterns is a set of testing principles and tools for Node.js/TypeScript backend, following a testing pyramid with recommended proportions of Unit, Integration, and E2E tests.","zh":"测试模式是指后端开发中使用的测试方法，包括单元测试、集成测试和E2E测试","ja":"テスティングパターンとはバックエンド開発で使用されるテスト方法であり、ユニットテスト、インテグレーションテスト、E2Eテスト等を含みます","ko":"테스팅 패턴은 백엔드 개발에서 사용되는 테스트 방법을 의미하며 유닛 테스트, 통합 테스트, E2E 테스트 등을 포함합니다","es":"Patrones de pruebas: enfoque estructurado para probar software, incluyendo pruebas unitarias, de integración y E2E","fr":"Modèles de tests: approche structurée pour tester des logiciels, incluant des tests unitaires, d''intégration et E2E","de":"Testmuster: strukturierter Ansatz zum Testen von Software, einschließlich Unit-Tests, Integrationstests und E2E-Tests","pt":"Padrões de teste são estruturas de teste que garantem a qualidade do código, incluindo testes unitários, de integração e E2E","ru":"Шаблоны тестирования - это структуры тестирования, которые обеспечивают качество кода, включая юнит-тесты, тесты интеграции и E2E для ИИ Агентов","ar":"نماذج الاختبار هي هياكل اختبار تضمن جودة الرمز، بما في ذلك الاختبارات الوحدوية واختبارات التكامل و E2E لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Implements a testing pyramid with 70% Unit, 20% Integration, and 10% E2E tests","Utilizes Jest and Supertest for efficient testing","Supports TypeScript for typed testing","Installs with npm using commands like ''npm install -D jest @types/jest ts-jest supertest @types/supertest''","Integrates with MongoDB using ''mongodb-m'' package","Follows a recommended testing proportion for optimal coverage"],"zh":["使用Jest + Supertest设置后端测试环境","支持单元测试、集成测试和E2E测试","推荐的测试比例：70%单元测试，20%集成测试，10%E2E测试","支持Node.js/TypeScript后端开发","使用mongodb-m进行数据库测试"],"ja":["Jest + Supertestを使用してバックエンドのテスト環境を設定","ユニットテスト、インテグレーションテスト、E2Eテストをサポート","推奨されるテスト比率：70%ユニットテスト、20%インテグレーションテスト、10%E2Eテスト","Node.js/TypeScriptバックエンド開発をサポート","mongodb-mを使用してデータベーステストを実行"],"ko":["Jest + Supertest를 사용하여 백엔드 테스트 환경을 설정","유닛 테스트, 통합 테스트, E2E 테스트를 지원","추천 테스트 비율: 70% 유닛 테스트, 20% 통합 테스트, 10% E2E 테스트","Node.js/TypeScript 백엔드 개발을 지원","mongodb-m을 사용하여 데이터베이스 테스트를 수행"],"es":["Pruebas unitarias con Jest","Pruebas de integración con Supertest","Pruebas E2E para fluxos críticos de API","Configuración de MongoDB para pruebas","Implementación de la pirámide de pruebas","Uso de TypeScript para pruebas"],"fr":["Tests unitaires avec Jest","Tests d''intégration avec Supertest","Tests E2E pour les flux critiques de l''API","Configuration de MongoDB pour les tests","Mise en œuvre de la pyramide de tests","Utilisation de TypeScript pour les tests"],"de":["Unit-Tests mit Jest","Integrationstests mit Supertest","E2E-Tests für kritische API-Flüsse","Konfiguration von MongoDB für Tests","Implementierung der Testpyramide","Verwendung von TypeScript für Tests"],"pt":["Configuração de Jest e Supertest para testar backend Node.js/TypeScript","Testes unitários, de integração e E2E para garantir a qualidade do código","Utilização de MongoDB para testes de integração","Suporte a TypeScript para desenvolvimento de código mais seguro","Padrão de teste recomendado: 70% Unit, 20% Integration, 10% E2E"],"ru":["Настройка Jest и Supertest для тестирования бэкенда Node.js/TypeScript для ИИ Агентов","Юнит-тесты, тесты интеграции и E2E для обеспечения качества кода","Использование MongoDB для тестов интеграции","Поддержка TypeScript для разработки более безопасного кода","Рекомендуемый шаблон тестирования: 70% Unit, 20% Integration, 10% E2E"],"ar":["تكوين Jest و Supertest لاختبار خلفية Node.js/TypeScript لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","اختبارات الوحدوية واختبارات التكامل و E2E لضمان جودة الرمز","استخدام MongoDB لاختبارات التكامل","دعم TypeScript لتطوير رمز أكثر أمانًا","نمط اختبار مقترح: 70% Unit, 20% Integration, 10% E2E"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use testing-patterns","testing-patterns setup guide","Node.js testing patterns","Jest and Supertest tutorial","testing-patterns vs Jest","testing-patterns install","testing-patterns alternative","what is testing-patterns","testing-patterns best practices"],"zh":["测试模式","Jest","Supertest","后端测试","Node.js","TypeScript","mongodb-m","AIエージェント","测试环境设置"],"ja":["テスティングパターン","Jest","Supertest","バックエンドテスト","Node.js","TypeScript","mongodb-m","AIエージェント","テスト環境設定"],"ko":["테스팅 패턴","Jest","Supertest","백엔드 테스트","Node.js","TypeScript","mongodb-m","AI 에이전트","테스트 환경 설정"],"es":["patrones de pruebas","Jest","Supertest","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de integración","pruebas E2E","Node.js","TypeScript","desarrollo de software","testing"],"fr":["modèles de tests","Jest","Supertest","tests unitaires","tests d''intégration","tests E2E","Node.js","TypeScript","développement de logiciels","testing"],"de":["Testmuster","Jest","Supertest","Unit-Tests","Integrationstests","E2E-Tests","Node.js","TypeScript","Softwareentwicklung","Testing"],"pt":["padrões de teste","Jest","Supertest","Node.js","TypeScript","testes unitários","testes de integração","E2E","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade do código"],"ru":["шаблоны тестирования","Jest","Supertest","Node.js","TypeScript","юнит-тесты","тесты интеграции","E2E","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["نماذج الاختبار","Jest","Supertest","Node.js","TypeScript","اختبارات الوحدوية","اختبارات التكامل","E2E","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الرمز","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"konecty","repo":"Konecty","repoPath":"konecty/Konecty","stars":19,"forks":8,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T18:43:09Z","topics":["business-process","business-solutions","crm-platform"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"testing-patterns","description":"Padrões de teste para Node.js/TypeScript backend com Jest e Supertest. Inclui unit tests, integration tests, mocking e boas práticas. Use ao escrever testes de API, services ou revisar estratégia de testes backend.","bodyPreview":"# Testing Patterns - Node.js/TypeScript Backend\n\n## Testing Pyramid\n\n```\n       /\\\n      /E2E\\        <- Poucos, fluxos críticos de API\n     /------\\\n    /  INT   \\     <- Alguns, endpoints completos  \n   /----------\\\n  /   UNIT     \\   <- Muitos, lógica de negócio\n /--------------\\\n```\n\n**Proporção recomendada**: 70% Unit, 20% Integration, 10% E2E\n\n---\n\n## Setup: Jest + Supertest\n\n### Instalação\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D jest @types/jest ts-jest supertest @types/supertest\nnpm install -D mongodb-m","body":"# Testing Patterns - Node.js/TypeScript Backend\n\n## Testing Pyramid\n\n```\n       /\\\n      /E2E\\        <- Poucos, fluxos críticos de API\n     /------\\\n    /  INT   \\     <- Alguns, endpoints completos  \n   /----------\\\n  /   UNIT     \\   <- Muitos, lógica de negócio\n /--------------\\\n```\n\n**Proporção recomendada**: 70% Unit, 20% Integration, 10% E2E\n\n---\n\n## Setup: Jest + Supertest\n\n### Instalação\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D jest @types/jest ts-jest supertest @types/supertest\nnpm install -D mongodb-memory-server  # Para testes com MongoDB\n```\n\n### Configuração\n\n```typescript\n// jest.config.ts\nexport default {\n  preset: ''ts-jest'',\n  testEnvironment: ''node'',\n  setupFilesAfterEnv: [''<rootDir>/__test__/globalSetup.ts''],\n  testMatch: [''**/__test__/**/*.test.ts''],\n  collectCoverageFrom: [\n    ''src/**/*.ts'',\n    ''!src/**/*.d.ts'',\n    ''!src/server/main.ts'',\n  ],\n  coverageThreshold: {\n    global: {\n      branches: 70,\n      functions: 70,\n      lines: 70,\n      statements: 70,\n    },\n  },\n};\n```\n\n```typescript\n// __test__/globalSetup.ts\nimport { MongoMemoryServer } from ''mongodb-memory-server'';\nimport mongoose from ''mongoose'';\n\nlet mongoServer: MongoMemoryServer;\n\nbeforeAll(async () => {\n  mongoServer = await MongoMemoryServer.create();\n  const uri = mongoServer.getUri();\n  await mongoose.connect(uri);\n});\n\nafterAll(async () => {\n  await mongoose.disconnect();\n  await mongoServer.stop();\n});\n\nafterEach(async () => {\n  // Limpar collections após cada teste\n  const collections = mongoose.connection.collections;\n  await Promise.all(\n    Object.values(collections).map(collection => collection.deleteMany({}))\n  );\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Unit Tests: Services e Funções\n\n### Testar Lógica de Negócio Isoladamente\n\n```typescript\n// services/userService.test.ts\nimport { UserService } from ''./userService'';\nimport { User } from ''../models/User'';\n\ndescribe(''UserService'', () => {\n  const userService = new UserService();\n  \n  describe(''createUser'', () => {\n    it(''should create user with hashed password'', async () => {\n      const userData = {\n        name: ''Test User'',\n        email: ''test@example.com'',\n        password: ''password123'',\n      };\n      \n      const user = await userService.createUser(userData);\n      \n      expect(user).toHaveProperty(''_id'');\n      expect(user.name).toBe(''Test User'');\n      expect(user.password).not.toBe(''password123''); // Deve estar hasheado\n      expect(user.password).toHaveLength(60); // bcrypt hash length\n    });\n    \n    it(''should throw error if email already exists'', async () => {\n      const userData = {\n        name: ''User'',\n        email: ''duplicate@example.com'',\n        password: ''password'',\n      };\n      \n      await userService.createUser(userData);\n      \n      await expect(userService.createUser(userData))\n        .rejects.toThrow(''Email already exists'');\n    });\n  });\n  \n  describe(''findActiveUsers'', () => {\n    beforeEach(async () => {\n      await User.create([\n        { name: ''Active 1'', email: ''a1@test.com'', active: true },\n        { name: ''Active 2'', email: ''a2@test.com'', active: true },\n        { name: ''Inactive'', email: ''i1@test.com'', active: false },\n      ]);\n    });\n    \n    it(''should return only active users'', async () => {\n      const users = await userService.findActiveUsers();\n      \n      expect(users).toHaveLength(2);\n      expect(users.every(u => u.active)).toBe(true);\n    });\n  });\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Integration Tests: API Endpoints\n\n### Testar Rotas Completas com Supertest\n\n```typescript\n// routes/users.test.ts\nimport request from ''supertest'';\nimport app from ''../app'';\nimport { User } from ''../models/User'';\n\nconst API_BASE = ''/api'';\nconst HTTP_OK = 200;\nconst HTTP_CREATED = 201;\nconst HTTP_BAD_REQUEST = 400;\nconst HTTP_NOT_FOUND = 404;\n\ndescribe(''User API'', () => {\n  describe(''POST /api/users'', () => {\n    it(''should create user and return 201'', async () => {\n      const userData = {\n        name: ''Test User'',\n        email: ''test@example.com'',\n        password: ''password123'',\n      };\n      \n      const response = await request(app)\n        .post(`${API_BASE}/users`)\n        .send(userData);\n      \n      expect(response.status).toBe(HTTP_CREATED);\n      expect(response.body.success).toBe(true);\n      expect(response.body.data).toHaveProperty(''id'');\n      expect(response.body.data.email).toBe(userData.email);\n      expect(response.body.data).not.toHaveProperty(''password''); // Não deve retornar senha\n    });\n    \n    it(''should return 400 for invalid data'', async () => {\n      const invalidData = {\n        name: '''',\n        email: ''invalid-email'',\n        password: ''123'', // muito curta\n      };\n      \n      const response = await request(app)\n        .post(`${API_BASE}/users`)\n        .send(invalidData);\n      \n      expect(response.status).toBe(HTTP_BAD_REQUEST);\n      expect(response.body.success).toBe(false);\n      expect(response.body.error).toBeTruthy();\n    });\n    \n    it(''should return 409 for duplicate email'', async () => {\n      const userData = {\n        name: ''User'',\n        email: ''duplicate@example.com'',\n        password: ''password'',\n      };\n      \n      // Criar primeiro usuário\n      await request(app).post(`${API_BASE}/users`).send(userData);\n      \n      // Tentar criar duplicado\n      const response = await request(app)\n        .post(`${API_BASE}/users`)\n        .send(userData);\n      \n      expect(response.status).toBe(409);\n      expect(response.body.error).toMatch(/email already exists/i);\n    });\n  });\n  \n  describe(''GET /api/users/:id'', () => {\n    it(''should return user by id'', async () => {\n      const user = await User.create({\n        name: ''Test'',\n        email: ''test@example.com'',\n        password: ''hashed'',\n      });\n      \n      const response = await request(app)\n        .get(`${API_BASE}/users/${user._id}`);\n      \n      expect(response.status).toBe(HTTP_OK);\n      expect(response.body.data.id).toBe(user._id.toString());\n      expect(response.body.data.name).toBe(''Test'');\n    });\n    \n    it(''should return 404 for non-existent user'', async () => {\n      const fakeId = ''507f1f77bcf86cd799439011'';\n      \n      const response = await request(app)\n        .get(`${API_BASE}/users/${fakeId}`);\n      \n      expect(response.status).toBe(HTTP_NOT_FOUND);\n      expect(response.body.error).toMatch(/not found/i);\n    });\n  });\n  \n  describe(''Authentication'', () => {\n    it(''should require auth token for protected routes'', async () => {\n      const response = await request(app)\n        .get(`${API_BASE}/protected`);\n      \n      expect(response.status).toBe(401);\n    });\n    \n    it(''should allow access with valid token'', async () => {\n      const token = ''valid-jwt-token''; // Gerar token de teste\n      \n      const response = await request(app)\n        .get(`${API_BASE}/protected`)\n        .set(''Authorization'', `Bearer ${token}`);\n      \n      expect(response.status).toBe(HTTP_OK);\n    });\n  });\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Mocking\n\n### Mock de Serviços Externos\n\n```typescript\n// __test__/mocks/emailService.ts\nexport const mockEmailService = {\n  sendEmail: vi.fn().mockResolvedValue(true),\n  sendWelcomeEmail: vi.fn().mockResolvedValue(true),\n};\n\n// Uso no teste\nvi.mock(''@/services/emailService'', () => ({\n  EmailService: vi.fn(() => mockEmailService),\n}));\n\nit(''should send welcome email on registration'', async () => {\n  const userData = { name: ''User'', email: ''user@test.com'', password: ''pass'' };\n  \n  await request(app).post(''/api/users'').send(userData);\n  \n  expect(mockEmailService.sendWelcomeEmail).toHaveBeenCalledWith(\n    ''user@test.com'',\n    ''User''\n  );\n});\n```\n\n### Mock de MongoDB\n\n```typescript\n// Para testes sem MongoDB real\nvi.mock(''mongoose'', () => ({\n  connect: vi.fn(),\n  model: vi.fn(),\n  Schema: vi.fn(),\n}));\n```\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### O que Testar\n\n✅ **TESTE:**\n- Lógica de negócio (validações, transformações)\n- Endpoints de API (request/response)\n- Error handling (casos de erro)\n- Autenticação e autorização\n- Database operations (CRUD)\n- Integração com serviços externos\n\n❌ **NÃO TESTE:**\n- Bibliotecas third-party (já testadas)\n- Código trivial (getters/setters simples)\n- Configurações (env, setup básico)\n\n### Organização de Testes\n\n```\n__test__/\n├── globalSetup.ts\n├── fixtures/\n│   └── users.json\n├── mocks/\n│   ├── emailService.ts\n│   └── paymentGateway.ts\n├── auth/\n│   ├── login.test.ts\n│   └── otp.test.ts\n├── data/\n│   └── api/\n│       ├── find.test.ts\n│       └── create.test.ts\n└── utils/\n    └── dateUtils.test.ts\n```\n\n### Naming Conventions\n\n```typescript\ndescribe(''UserService'', () => {\n  describe(''createUser'', () => {\n    it(''should create user with valid data'', async () => { });\n    it(''should throw ValidationError for invalid data'', async () => { });\n    it(''should hash password before saving'', async () => { });\n  });\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist Rápido\n\nAntes de commitar testes:\n\n- [ ] Testa lógica de negócio crítica?\n- [ ] Endpoints têm testes de success e error?\n- [ ] Mock de serviços externos?\n- [ ] Usa MongoDB Memory Server para testes?\n- [ ] Limpa database após cada teste?\n- [ ] Testes são independentes?\n- [ ] Nomes descritivos (\"should ... when ...\")?\n- [ ] Cobertura >70% do código crítico?\n- [ ] Autenticação testada?\n- [ ] Error cases cobertos?\n\n---\n\n## Recursos Adicionais\n\n- [examples/](examples/) - Exemplos completos\n- Jest: https://jestjs.io\n- Supertest: https://github.com/ladjs/supertest\n- MongoDB Memory Server: https://github.com/nodkz/mongodb-memory-server\n\n---\n\n**Filosofia**: Teste comportamento da API, não implementação interna.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:42:12.552Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Node.js/TypeScript Agents needing comprehensive testing capabilities with Jest and Supertest.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Jest和Supertest进行全面测试的Node.js/TypeScript代理。","ja":"JestとSupertestを使用した包括的なテスト機能を必要とするNode.js/TypeScriptエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Jest와 Supertest를 사용하여 포괄적인 테스트 기능을 필요한 Node.js/TypeScript 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Node.js/TypeScript que necesitan capacidades de prueba comprehensivas con Jest y Supertest.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Node.js/TypeScript nécessitant des capacités de test complètes avec Jest et Supertest.","de":"Perfekt für Node.js/TypeScript-Agents, die umfassende Testfunktionen mit Jest und Supertest benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Node.js/TypeScript que necessitam de capacidades de teste abrangentes com Jest e Supertest.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Node.js/TypeScript, требующих всесторонних возможностей тестирования с Jest и Supertest.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء Node.js/TypeScript الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات اختبار شاملة مع Jest و Supertest."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement a testing pyramid with 70% Unit, 20% Integration, and 10% E2E tests, utilizing Jest and Supertest for robust backend testing, including critical API flows and business logic validation.","zh":"赋予代理实现测试金字塔的能力，70%的单元测试，20%的集成测试和10%的E2E测试，利用Jest和Supertest进行强大的后端测试，包括关键的API流程和业务逻辑验证。","ja":"エージェントに、JestとSupertestを使用した堅牢なバックエンドテストを含む、70%のユニットテスト、20%の統合テスト、10%のE2Eテストで構成されるテストピラミッドを実装する能力を提供します。包括的なAPIフローとビジネスロジックの検証に使用されます。","ko":"에이전트에게 Jest와 Supertest를 사용하여 강력한 백엔드 테스트를 포함하여 70%의 유닛 테스트, 20%의 통합 테스트 및 10%의 E2E 테스트로 구성된 테스트 피라미드를 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 이는 중요한 API 흐름 및 비즈니스 논리 확인에 사용됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar una pirámide de pruebas con 70% de pruebas unitarias, 20% de pruebas de integración y 10% de pruebas E2E, utilizando Jest y Supertest para pruebas de backend robustas, incluyendo flujos de API críticos y validación de lógica de negocio.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre une pyramide de tests avec 70% de tests unitaires, 20% de tests d''intégration et 10% de tests E2E, en utilisant Jest et Supertest pour des tests de backend robustes, notamment les flux d''API critiques et la validation de la logique métier.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eine Testpyramide mit 70% Unit-Tests, 20% Integrationstests und 10% E2E-Tests zu implementieren, wobei Jest und Supertest für robuste Backendentests verwendet werden, einschließlich kritischer API-Flows und Geschäftlogikvalidierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar uma pirâmide de testes com 70% de testes de unidade, 20% de testes de integração e 10% de testes E2E, utilizando Jest e Supertest para testes robustos de backend, incluindo fluxos de API críticos e validação de lógica de negócios.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовать пирамиду тестирования с 70% юнит-тестов, 20% интеграционных тестов и 10% тестов E2E, используя Jest и Supertest для надежного тестирования бэкенда, включая критические потоки API и валидацию бизнес-логики.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تنفيذ هرم اختبار مع 70٪ من اختبارات الوحدة و 20٪ من اختبارات التكامل و 10٪ من اختبارات E2E، باستخدام Jest و Supertest لاختبارات الخادم الخلفي القوية، بما في ذلك تدفقات API الحرجة وتنفيذ منطق الأعمال."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating unit tests for business logic","Generating integration tests for API endpoints","Debugging E2E tests for critical workflows"],"zh":["为业务逻辑自动化单元测试","为API端点生成集成测试","为关键工作流调试E2E测试"],"ja":["ビジネスロジックの自動ユニットテスト","APIエンドポイントの統合テストの生成","重要なワークフローのE2Eテストのデバッグ"],"ko":["비즈니스 논리의 자동 유닛 테스트","API 엔드포인트에 대한 통합 테스트 생성","중요한 워크플로우에 대한 E2E 테스트 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas unitarias para lógica de negocio","Generar pruebas de integración para puntos de conexión de API","Depurar pruebas E2E para flujos de trabajo críticos"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests unitaires pour la logique métier","Générer des tests d''intégration pour les points de terminaison d''API","Déboguer les tests E2E pour les flux de travail critiques"],"de":["Automatisieren von Unit-Tests für Geschäftlogik","Generieren von Integrationstests für API-Endpunkte","Debuggen von E2E-Tests für kritische Workflows"],"pt":["Automizar testes de unidade para lógica de negócios","Gerar testes de integração para pontos finais de API","Depurar testes E2E para fluxos de trabalho críticos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать юнит-тесты для бизнес-логики","Генерировать интеграционные тесты для точек API","Отладить тесты E2E для критических рабочих процессов"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبارات الوحدة لمنطق الأعمال","توليد اختبارات التكامل لنقاط نهاية API","تصحيح اختبارات E2E لتدفقات العمل الحرجة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js and TypeScript environment","Dependent on Jest and Supertest libraries"],"zh":["需要Node.js和TypeScript环境","依赖于Jest和Supertest库"],"ja":["Node.jsとTypeScript環境が必要","JestとSupertestライブラリに依存"],"ko":["Node.js와 TypeScript 환경이 필요","Jest와 Supertest 라이브러리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere entorno Node.js y TypeScript","Dependiente de las bibliotecas Jest y Supertest"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js et TypeScript","Dépend des bibliothèques Jest et Supertest"],"de":["Benötigt Node.js- und TypeScript-Umgebung","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken Jest und Supertest"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Node.js e TypeScript","Dependente das bibliotecas Jest e Supertest"],"ru":["Требуется среда Node.js и TypeScript","Зависит от библиотек Jest и Supertest"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js و TypeScript","يعتمد على مكتبات Jest و Supertest"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"15288bc0c8c31ba19fade086a59c804b5443edcdb903c45dc06fdf9176415943","qualityScore":36}');
