hten","pt":"Ruby-patterns é um conjunto de diretrizes para desenvolvedores Ruby, focado em padrões de desenvolvimento e configuração de projetos","ru":"Ruby-паттерны - это набор руководств для разработчиков Ruby, фокусирующихся на шаблонах разработки и настройке проектов","ar":"أنماط روبي هي مجموعة من الإرشادات للمطورين روبي، تركز على أنماط التطوير وتكوين المشاريع"},"features":{"en":["Detects package managers using Gemfile.lock and Gemfile","Installs dependencies using bundle install or gem install","Runs Ruby commands using bundle exec or ruby","Follows critical rules to avoid using gem install directly with Gemfile","Scaffolds new projects with optimized setup"],"zh":["包管理器检测（Bundler、gem/ruby）","新项目设置","Gemfile 和 Gemfile.lock 管理","避免直接使用 gem install","使用 bundle exec 运行 Ruby 命令"],"ja":["パッケージマネージャー検出（Bundler、gem/ruby）","新規プロジェクト設定","Gemfile と Gemfile.lock 管理","gem install を直接使用しない","bundle exec で Ruby コマンドを実行"],"ko":["패키지 관리자 감지（Bundler、gem/ruby）","새로운 프로젝트 설정","Gemfile 및 Gemfile.lock 관리","gem install 직접 사용하지 않기","bundle exec로 Ruby 명령어 실행"],"es":["Detección del administrador de paquetes (Bundler, gem/ruby)","Instalación y ejecución de comandos con Bundle","Configuración de nuevos proyectos con Gemfile y Gemfile.lock","Evitación del uso directo de `gem install` cuando existe Gemfile","Soporte para proyectos Ruby con diferentes administradores de paquetes"],"fr":["Détection du gestionnaire de paquets (Bundler, gem/ruby)","Installation et exécution de commandes avec Bundle","Configuration de nouveaux projets avec Gemfile et Gemfile.lock","Évitement de l''utilisation directe de `gem install` lorsque Gemfile existe","Prise en charge de projets Ruby avec différents gestionnaires de paquets"],"de":["Erkennung des Paket-Managers (Bundler, gem/ruby)","Installation und Ausführung von Befehlen mit Bundle","Einrichtung neuer Projekte mit Gemfile und Gemfile.lock","Vermeidung der direkten Verwendung von `gem install` wenn Gemfile existiert","Unterstützung für Ruby-Projekte mit verschiedenen Paket-Managern"],"pt":["Detecção de gerenciadores de pacotes (Bundler, gem/ruby)","Configuração de projetos com Gemfile e Gemfile.lock","Instalação e execução de pacotes com bundle install e bundle exec","Suporte à criação de novos projetos com scaffolding","Padrões de desenvolvimento para projetos Ruby","Melhores práticas para desenvolvedores Ruby"],"ru":["Обнаружение менеджеров пакетов (Bundler, gem/ruby)","Настройка проектов с Gemfile и Gemfile.lock","Установка и запуск пакетов с bundle install и bundle exec","Поддержка создания новых проектов с scaffolding","Шаблоны разработки для проектов Ruby","Лучшие практики для разработчиков Ruby"],"ar":["كشف المديرين الحزمة (Bundler, gem/ruby)","تكوين المشاريع مع Gemfile و Gemfile.lock","تثبيت وتنفيذ الحزم مع bundle install و bundle exec","دعم إنشاء مشاريع جديدة مع scaffolding","أنماط التطوير لمشاريع روبي","أفضل الممارسات للمطورين روبي"]},"keywords":{"en":["ruby-patterns setup guide","how to use ruby-patterns","what is ruby-patterns","ruby-patterns vs bundler","ruby-patterns install","ruby development best practices","Gemfile.lock management","bundle exec commands"],"zh":["Ruby 开发模式","包管理器检测","新项目设置","Gemfile","Gemfile.lock","Bundler","gem/ruby","AI工具","Ruby 设置指南"],"ja":["Ruby 開発パターン","パッケージマネージャー検出","新規プロジェクト設定","Gemfile","Gemfile.lock","Bundler","gem/ruby","AIエージェント","Ruby 設定ガイド"],"ko":["Ruby 개발 패턴","패키지 관리자 감지","새로운 프로젝트 설정","Gemfile","Gemfile.lock","Bundler","gem/ruby","AI 에이전트","Ruby 설정 가이드"],"es":["patrones de Ruby","administrador de paquetes","Bundler","gem/ruby","configuración de proyectos Ruby","Gemfile","Gemfile.lock","desarrollo de software con Ruby","herramientas de desarrollo Ruby"],"fr":["modèles Ruby","gestionnaire de paquets","Bundler","gem/ruby","configuration de projets Ruby","Gemfile","Gemfile.lock","développement de logiciels avec Ruby","outils de développement Ruby"],"de":["Ruby-Muster","Paket-Manager","Bundler","gem/ruby","Einrichtung von Ruby-Projekten","Gemfile","Gemfile.lock","Software-Entwicklung mit Ruby","Entwicklungstools für Ruby"],"pt":["ruby patterns","desenvolvimento ruby","gerenciadores de pacotes","bundler","gemfile","gemfile.lock","scaffolding","melhores práticas ruby","padrões de desenvolvimento ruby"],"ru":["ruby-паттерны","разработка ruby","менеджеры пакетов","bundler","gemfile","gemfile.lock","scaffolding","лучшие практики ruby","шаблоны разработки ruby"],"ar":["أنماط روبي","تطوير روبي","مديري الحزم","bundler","gemfile","gemfile.lock","scaffolding","أفضل الممارسات روبي","أنماط التطوير روبي"]}},"owner":"cooldaemon","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"cooldaemon/dotfiles","stars":13,"forks":8,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T12:49:32Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ruby-patterns","description":"Ruby development patterns including package manager detection (Bundler), project structure, and idiomatic Ruby practices.","bodyPreview":"# Ruby Development Patterns\n\n## Package Manager Detection (CRITICAL)\n\n**Before running ANY Ruby commands, detect the package manager:**\n\n| File | Package Manager | Install | Run |\n|------|-----------------|---------|-----|\n| `Gemfile.lock` | Bundler | `bundle install` | `bundle exec` |\n| `Gemfile` (no lock) | Bundler | `bundle install` | `bundle exec` |\n| None | gem/ruby | `gem install` | `ruby` |\n\n**NEVER use `gem install` directly when Gemfile exists.**\n\n### New Project Setup\n\nWhen scaffolding","body":"# Ruby Development Patterns\n\n## Package Manager Detection (CRITICAL)\n\n**Before running ANY Ruby commands, detect the package manager:**\n\n| File | Package Manager | Install | Run |\n|------|-----------------|---------|-----|\n| `Gemfile.lock` | Bundler | `bundle install` | `bundle exec` |\n| `Gemfile` (no lock) | Bundler | `bundle install` | `bundle exec` |\n| None | gem/ruby | `gem install` | `ruby` |\n\n**NEVER use `gem install` directly when Gemfile exists.**\n\n### New Project Setup\n\nWhen scaffolding a new Ruby project, always initialize with Bundler:\n\n```bash\nbundle init          # Creates Gemfile\n# Edit Gemfile to add dependencies\nbundle install       # Creates Gemfile.lock\n```\n\nFor gem libraries, use `bundle gem mylib` to scaffold the full structure.\n\n**Follow the existing project''s Gemfile. Always use `bundle exec` to run commands.**\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nmyproject/\n├── lib/                # Source code\n│   ├── myproject.rb    # Main entry point\n│   └── myproject/      # Namespace directory\n│       ├── cli.rb\n│       └── core.rb\n├── spec/               # RSpec tests (preferred)\n│   ├── spec_helper.rb\n│   └── myproject/\n│       └── core_spec.rb\n├── bin/                # Executables\n├── Gemfile\n├── Gemfile.lock\n├── Rakefile\n└── Makefile\n```\n\n## CLI Structure\n\n**Three-layer separation (same principle as Python):**\n\n```ruby\n# bin/myproject - Minimal bootstrap\n#!/usr/bin/env ruby\nrequire_relative \"../lib/myproject/cli\"\nMyProject::CLI.run(ARGV)\n\n# lib/myproject/cli.rb - CLI argument parsing only\nrequire_relative \"core\"\n\nmodule MyProject\n  class CLI\n    def self.run(args)\n      result = Core.process(args.first)\n      puts result\n    end\n  end\nend\n\n# lib/myproject/core.rb - Business logic (testable without CLI)\nmodule MyProject\n  class Core\n    def self.process(input)\n      # ...\n    end\n  end\nend\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T01:58:22.034Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Ruby Development Agents needing consistent project configuration and package manager detection.","zh":"非常适合需要一致的项目配置和包管理器检测的Ruby开发代理。","ja":"一貫したプロジェクト構成とパッケージマネージャ検出が必要なRuby開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"일관된 프로젝트 구성과 패키지 관리자 감지가 필요한 Ruby 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Ruby que necesitan una configuración de proyecto consistente y detección de administrador de paquetes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Ruby nécessitant une configuration de projet cohérente et une détection de gestionnaire de paquets.","de":"Perfekt für Ruby-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine konsistente Projekt-Konfiguration und eine Paket-Manager-Erkennung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Ruby que necessitam de configuração de projeto consistente e detecção de gerenciador de pacotes.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки Ruby, требующих последовательной настройки проекта и обнаружения менеджера пакетов.","ar":" مثالي لعميل تطوير Ruby الذي يحتاج إلى تكوين مشروع متسق وكشف عن مدير الحزم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Ruby project setup using Bundler and gem/ruby, ensuring efficient package installation and execution with `bundle install` and `bundle exec` commands, while avoiding direct use of `gem install` when Gemfile exists.","zh":"赋予代理人使用Bundler和gem/ruby自动化Ruby项目设置的能力，确保使用`bundle install`和`bundle exec`命令高效地安装和执行包，同时避免在Gemfile存在时直接使用`gem install`。","ja":"Bundlerとgem/rubyを使用してRubyプロジェクトの設定を自動化する機能をエージェントに提供し、`bundle install`と`bundle exec`コマンドを使用してパッケージのインストールと実行を効率的に行い、Gemfileが存在する場合に`gem install`を直接使用しないようにします。","ko":"Bundler와 gem/ruby를 사용하여 Ruby 프로젝트 설정을 자동화할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에게 제공하여 `bundle install` 및 `bundle exec` 명령을 사용하여 패키지 설치 및 실행을 효율적으로 수행하며 Gemfile이 존재하는 경우 `gem install`를 직접 사용하지 않도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la configuración del proyecto Ruby utilizando Bundler y gem/ruby, garantizando una instalación y ejecución de paquetes eficientes con los comandos `bundle install` y `bundle exec`, mientras evita el uso directo de `gem install` cuando existe Gemfile.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la configuration du projet Ruby à l''aide de Bundler et gem/ruby, en garantissant une installation et une exécution de paquets efficaces avec les commandes `bundle install` et `bundle exec`, tout en évitant l''utilisation directe de `gem install` lorsque Gemfile existe.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Ruby-Projekt-Konfiguration mithilfe von Bundler und gem/ruby zu automatisieren, wodurch eine effiziente Paket-Installation und -Ausführung mit den Befehlen `bundle install` und `bundle exec` gewährleistet wird, während der direkte Einsatz von `gem install` vermieden wird, wenn eine Gemfile vorhanden ist.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a configuração do projeto Ruby usando Bundler e gem/ruby, garantindo a instalação eficiente de pacotes e execução com os comandos `bundle install` e `bundle exec`, evitando o uso direto de `gem install` quando o Gemfile existe.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать настройку проекта Ruby с помощью Bundler и gem/ruby, обеспечивая эффективную установку пакетов и выполнение команд `bundle install` и `bundle exec`, избегая прямого использования `gem install` при наличии Gemfile.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على ت自动化 إعداد مشروع Ruby باستخدام Bundler و gem/ruby، مما يضمن تثبيت الحزم بكفاءة وتنفيذها بأوامر `bundle install` و `bundle exec`، وتجنب استخدام `gem install` المباشر عند وجود Gemfile."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating package manager detection for Ruby projects","Generating new project setups with Bundler and gem/ruby","Optimizing project configuration for consistent development environments"],"zh":["自动检测Ruby项目的包管理器","使用Bundler和gem/ruby生成新的项目设置","优化项目配置以实现一致的开发环境"],"ja":["Rubyプロジェクトのパッケージマネージャの自動検出","Bundlerとgem/rubyを使用して新しいプロジェクト設定を生成する","一貫した開発環境を実現するためのプロジェクト構成の最適化"],"ko":["Ruby 프로젝트의 패키지 관리자 자동 감지","Bundler와 gem/ruby를 사용하여 새로운 프로젝트 설정 생성","일관된 개발 환경을 위한 프로젝트 구성 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar la detección del administrador de paquetes para proyectos Ruby","Generar nuevas configuraciones de proyecto con Bundler y gem/ruby","Optimizar la configuración del proyecto para entornos de desarrollo coherentes"],"fr":["Automatiser la détection du gestionnaire de paquets pour les projets Ruby","Générer de nouvelles configurations de projet avec Bundler et gem/ruby","Optimiser la configuration du projet pour des environnements de développement cohérents"],"de":["Automatisieren der Paket-Manager-Erkennung für Ruby-Projekte","Erstellen neuer Projekt-Konfigurationen mit Bundler und gem/ruby","Optimieren der Projekt-Konfiguration für konsistente Entwicklungsumgebungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a detecção do gerenciador de pacotes para projetos Ruby","Gerar novas configurações de projeto com Bundler e gem/ruby","Otimizar a configuração do projeto para ambientes de desenvolvimento consistentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обнаружение менеджера пакетов для проектов Ruby","Генерировать новые настройки проекта с помощью Bundler и gem/ruby","Оптимизировать настройку проекта для последовательных сред разработки"],"ar":["تأتمتة كشف مدير الحزم لمشاريع Ruby","إعداد إعدادات مشروع جديدة باستخدام Bundler و gem/ruby","تحسين تكوين المشروع لأنظمة التطوير المتسقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Ruby environment","Limited to Bundler and gem/ruby package managers"],"zh":["需要Ruby环境","仅限于Bundler和gem/ruby包管理器"],"ja":["Ruby環境が必要","Bundlerとgem/rubyパッケージマネージャーのみに限定"],"ko":["Ruby 환경이 필요","Bundler와 gem/ruby 패키지 관리자만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere entorno Ruby","Limitado a los administradores de paquetes Bundler y gem/ruby"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Ruby","Limité aux gestionnaires de paquets Bundler et gem/ruby"],"de":["Benötigt Ruby-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Paket-Manager Bundler und gem/ruby"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Ruby","Limitado a gerenciadores de pacotes Bundler e gem/ruby"],"ru":["Требует среды Ruby","Ограничен менеджерами пакетов Bundler и gem/ruby"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Ruby","محدود بمديري الحزم Bundler و gem/ruby"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"e90b0140698ff24c81d8950ba132cfa5afdc410d43a23b6a5a0b884edd6f174e","qualityScore":36}');
