 npm","Definición de flujos de trabajo simples con TypeScript"],"fr":["Prise en charge de fonctions serveur durables avec QStash","Exposition de points de terminaison de workflow","Exécution de workflows de manière fiable","Installation facile avec npm","Définition de workflows simples avec TypeScript"],"de":["Unterstützung für zuverlässige Serverless-Funktionen mit QStash","Exponieren von Workflow-Endpunkten","Ausführung von Workflows zuverlässig","Einfache Installation mit npm","Definition einfacher Workflows mit TypeScript"],"pt":["Crie endpoints de workflow serverless com facilidade","Execute workflows de forma confiável usando QStash","Defina workflows com vários passos usando async/await","Instale com facilidade usando npm","Suporte a funções serverless duráveis e performáticas"],"ru":["Создайте конечные точки серверных рабочих процессов легко","Выполняйте рабочие процессы надежно с помощью QStash","Определите рабочие процессы с несколькими шагами с помощью async/await","Установите легко с помощью npm","Поддержка надёжных и производительных серверных функций"],"ar":["أنشئ نهايات نقطة سير عمل الخادمية بدون خادم بسهولة","تشغيل سير عمل بثبات باستخدام QStash","حدد سير عمل مع العديد من الخطوات باستخدام async/await","قم بتثبيت بسهولة باستخدام npm","دعم أدوات خادمية بدون خادم موثوقة وقابلة للتوسيع"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use upstash-workflow-js","upstash-workflow-js setup guide","upstash-workflow-js install","upstash-workflow-js vs qstash","upstash-workflow-js alternative","serverless workflow sdk","reliable serverless functions","performant workflow execution"],"zh":["Upstash Workflow JS","Serverless 函数","QStash","工作流运行","async/await","npm 安装","AI エージェント","Serverless 架构"],"ja":["Upstash Workflow JS","サーバーレス関数","QStash","ワークフロー実行","async/await","npm インストール","AI エージェント","サーバーレス アーキテクチャ"],"ko":["Upstash Workflow JS","Serverless 함수","QStash","워크플로우 실행","async/await","npm 설치","AI 에이전트","서버리스 아키텍처"],"es":["upstash-workflow-js","funciones servidoras duraderas","QStash","npm","TypeScript","Serverless","Herramientas de desarrollo de software","Agentes de inteligencia artificial","Herramientas de flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["upstash-workflow-js","fonctions serveur durables","QStash","npm","TypeScript","Serveurless","Outils de développement de logiciels","Agents d''intelligence artificielle","Outils de workflow"],"de":["upstash-workflow-js","zuverlässige Serverless-Funktionen","QStash","npm","TypeScript","Serverless","Software-Entwicklungstools","Künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten","Workflow-Tools"],"pt":["upstash workflow js","funções serverless","qstash","npm","serverless functions","workflow endpoints","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologias de servidor"],"ru":["upstash workflow js","серверные функции","qstash","npm","serverless functions","конечные точки рабочего процесса","разработка программного обеспечения","серверные технологии"],"ar":["upstash workflow js","أدوات خادمية بدون خادم","qstash","npm","serverless functions","نهايات نقطة سير عمل","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا الخادم"]}},"owner":"upstash","repo":"workflow-js","repoPath":"upstash/workflow-js","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.270Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upstash-workflow-js","description":"Lightweight guidance for using the Upstash Workflow SDK to define, trigger, and manage workflows. Use this Skill whenever a user wants to create workflow endpoints, run steps, or interact with the Upstash Workflow client.","bodyPreview":"# Upstash Workflow SDK\n\n## Quick Start\n\nThe Upstash Workflow SDK lets you expose serverless workflow endpoints and run them reliably using QStash under the hood.\n\nInstall:\n\n```bash\nnpm install @upstash/workflow\n```\n\nDefine a simple workflow endpoint:\n\n```ts\nimport { serve } from \"@upstash/workflow\";\n\nexport const { POST } = serve(async (context) => {\n  await context.run(\"step-1\", () => console.log(\"step 1\"));\n  await context.run(\"step-2\", () => console.log(\"step 2\"));\n});\n```\n\nTrigger it from yo","body":"# Upstash Workflow SDK\n\n## Quick Start\n\nThe Upstash Workflow SDK lets you expose serverless workflow endpoints and run them reliably using QStash under the hood.\n\nInstall:\n\n```bash\nnpm install @upstash/workflow\n```\n\nDefine a simple workflow endpoint:\n\n```ts\nimport { serve } from \"@upstash/workflow\";\n\nexport const { POST } = serve(async (context) => {\n  await context.run(\"step-1\", () => console.log(\"step 1\"));\n  await context.run(\"step-2\", () => console.log(\"step 2\"));\n});\n```\n\nTrigger it from your backend:\n\n```ts\nimport { Client } from \"@upstash/workflow\";\n\nconst client = new Client({ token: process.env.QSTASH_TOKEN! });\nawait client.trigger({ url: \"https://your-app.com/api/workflow\" });\n```\n\n## Other Skill Files\n\nThese files contain the full documentation. Use them for details, patterns, and advanced behavior.\n\n- basics:\n  - **basics/serve** – How to expose workflow endpoints.\n  - **basics/context** – Full API for workflow `context` (steps, waits, webhooks, events, invoke, etc.).\n  - **basics/client** – Using the Workflow client to trigger, cancel, inspect, and notify runs.\n- features:\n  - **features/invoke** – Cross‑workflow invocation.\n  - **features/reliability** – Retries, failure callbacks, and DLQ.\n  - **features/flow-control** – Rate limits, concurrency, and parallelism.\n  - **features/wait-for-event** – Notify and wait-for-event patterns.\n  - **features/webhooks** – Webhook creation and consumption.\n- how to:\n  - **how-to/local-dev** – Local QStash dev server and tunneling.\n  - **how-to/realtime** – Realtime and human‑in‑the‑loop workflows.\n  - **how-to/migrations** – Migrating workflows safely.\n  - **how-to/middleware** – Adding middleware to workflows.\n- other files:\n  - **rest-api** – Low-level REST endpoints for interacting with QStash/Workflow.\n  - **troubleshooting** – Common debugging and environment issues.\n  - **agents** – Using Workflow with agents, orchestrators, and automation patterns.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:08.580Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Serverless Agents needing reliable workflow endpoint management using QStash.","zh":"适合需要使用 QStash 进行可靠的工作流端点管理的 Serverless Agents。","ja":"QStash を使用した信頼性の高いワークフロー エンドポイント管理が必要な Serverless Agents に適しています。","ko":"QStash를 사용하여 안정적인 워크플로우 엔드포인트 관리가 필요한 Serverless Agents에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes sin servidor que necesitan una gestión de puntos de conexión de flujo de trabajo confiable utilizando QStash.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents sans serveur ayant besoin d''une gestion de points de terminaison de workflow fiable à l''aide de QStash.","de":"Perfekt für Serverless-Agents, die eine zuverlässige Workflow-Endpunktverwaltung mit QStash benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Serverless que precisam de gerenciamento de endpoint de workflow confiável usando QStash.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Serverless, которым требуется надежное управление конечными точками рабочих процессов с помощью QStash.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الخادمون الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة نهاية تدفق العمل الموثوقة باستخدام QStash."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to expose serverless workflow endpoints and run them reliably using QStash, providing a robust workflow management system with features like serverless function execution and endpoint exposure via the @upstash/workflow library.","zh":"赋予代理暴露无服务器工作流端点并使用 QStash 运行它们的能力，提供了一个强大的工作流管理系统，具有无服务器函数执行和通过 @upstash/workflow 库的端点暴露等功能。","ja":"@upstash/workflow ライブラリを介したエンドポイントの公開などの機能を備えた強力なワークフロー管理システムを提供し、QStash を使用してエージェントがサーバーレス ワークフロー エンドポイントを公開し、信頼性の高いワークフローを実行できるようにします。","ko":"@upstash/workflow 라이브러리를 통해 엔드포인트를 노출하는 등의 기능을 제공하는 강력한 워크플로우 관리 시스템을 제공하여 에이전트가 QStash를 사용하여 서버리스 워크플로우 엔드포인트를 노출하고 신뢰할 수 있는 워크플로우를 실행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para exponer puntos de conexión de flujo de trabajo sin servidor y ejecutarlos de forma confiable utilizando QStash, brindando un sistema de gestión de flujo de trabajo robusto con características como la ejecución de funciones sin servidor y la exposición de puntos de conexión a través de la biblioteca @upstash/workflow.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exposer des points de terminaison de workflow sans serveur et de les exécuter de manière fiable à l''aide de QStash, fournissant un système de gestion de workflow robuste avec des fonctionnalités comme l''exécution de fonctions sans serveur et l''exposition de points de terminaison via la bibliothèque @upstash/workflow.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, serverlose Workflow-Endpunkte zu exponieren und sie zuverlässig mit QStash auszuführen, wodurch ein robustes Workflow-Management-System mit Funktionen wie serverloser Funktionsausführung und Endpunkt-Exposition über die @upstash/workflow-Bibliothek bereitgestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a expor pontos de extremidade de fluxo de trabalho sem servidor e executá-los de forma confiável usando QStash, fornecendo um sistema de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho robusto com recursos como execução de função sem servidor e exposição de pontos de extremidade via biblioteca @upstash/workflow.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью экспонировать конечные точки рабочих процессов без сервера и запускать их надежно с помощью QStash, обеспечивая надежную систему управления рабочими процессами с функциями, такими как выполнение функций без сервера и экспонирование конечных точек через библиотеку @upstash/workflow.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من وضع نقاط النهاية لتدفق العمل بدون خادم وتشغيلها بشكل موثوق باستخدام QStash، مما يوفر نظام إدارة تدفق عمل قوي مع ميزات مثل تنفيذ الدالة بدون خادم ووضع نقاط النهاية عبر مكتبة @upstash/workflow."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining serverless workflow endpoints","Executing reliable workflow functions using QStash","Triggering serverless workflows from external sources"],"zh":["定义无服务器工作流端点","使用 QStash 执行可靠的工作流函数","从外部源触发无服务器工作流"],"ja":["サーバーレス ワークフロー エンドポイントを定義する","QStash を使用して信頼性の高いワークフロー関数を実行する","外部ソースからサーバーレス ワークフローをトリガーする"],"ko":["서버리스 워크플로우 엔드포인트를 정의하는 것","QStash를 사용하여 신뢰할 수 있는 워크플로우 함수를 실행하는 것","외부 소스에서 서버리스 워크플로우를 트리거하는 것"],"es":["Definir puntos de conexión de flujo de trabajo sin servidor","Ejecutar funciones de flujo de trabajo confiables utilizando QStash","Activar flujos de trabajo sin servidor desde fuentes externas"],"fr":["Définir des points de terminaison de workflow sans serveur","Exécuter des fonctions de workflow fiables à l''aide de QStash","Déclencher des workflows sans serveur à partir de sources externes"],"de":["Definieren von serverlosen Workflow-Endpunkten","Ausführen zuverlässiger Workflow-Funktionen mit QStash","Auslösen serverloser Workflows aus externen Quellen"],"pt":["Definindo pontos de extremidade de fluxo de trabalho sem servidor","Executando funções de fluxo de trabalho confiáveis usando QStash","Acionando fluxos de trabalho sem servidor a partir de fontes externas"],"ru":["Определение конечных точек рабочих процессов без сервера","Выполнение надежных функций рабочих процессов с помощью QStash","Запуск рабочих процессов без сервера из внешних источников"],"ar":["تحديد نقاط النهاية لتدفق العمل بدون خادم","تشغيل وظائف تدفق العمل الموثوقة باستخدام QStash","تشغيل تدفقات العمل بدون خادم من مصادر خارجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires installation of @upstash/workflow via npm","Dependent on QStash for reliable workflow execution"],"zh":["需要通过 npm 安装 @upstash/workflow","依赖 QStash 进行可靠的工作流执行"],"ja":["@upstash/workflow を npm 経由でインストールする必要がある","信頼性の高いワークフロー実行には QStash への依存が必要"],"ko":["@upstash/workflow를 npm을 통해 설치해야 함","신뢰할 수 있는 워크플로우 실행에는 QStash에 대한 의존이 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de @upstash/workflow a través de npm","Dependiente de QStash para la ejecución confiable del flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de @upstash/workflow via npm","Dépend de QStash pour l''exécution fiable du workflow"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von @upstash/workflow über npm","Abhängig von QStash für die zuverlässige Workflow-Ausführung"],"pt":["Requer instalação do @upstash/workflow via npm","Dependente de QStash para execução de fluxo de trabalho confiável"],"ru":["Требует установки @upstash/workflow через npm","Зависит от QStash для надежного выполнения рабочих процессов"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت @upstash/workflow عبر npm","يعتمد على QStash لتنفيذ تدفق العمل الموثوق"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"8d94ad14a754cbf10a5c6908205a38955dfae9232cd197d2187830435c7f017b","qualityScore":36}');
