INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('remorses/playwriter/playwriter', 'playwriter', 'remorses', 'playwriter', 'community', 'playwriter remorses playwriter community playwriter is a Chrome extension that lets agents control your browser, running Playwright snippets in a stateful sandbox. It benefits AI agents and developers who need to automate browser interactions. Playwriter是一个Chrome扩展，允许代理控制浏览器，运行Playwright代码段在stateful sandbox中 PlaywriterはChrome拡張機能で、エージェントがブラウザを制御できるようにし、Playwrightスニペットをstateful sandboxで実行 Playwriter는 크롬 확장 프로그램으로 에이전트가 브라우저를 제어할 수 있게 해주고 stateful sandbox에서 Playwright 코드 조각을 실행합니다. playwriter es una extensión de Chrome que permite a los agentes controlar tu navegador ejecutando snippets de Playwright en un entorno de sandbox con estado playwriter est une extension Chrome qui permet aux outils IA de contrôler votre navigateur en exécutant des extraits de code Playwright dans un environnement de sandbox étatique playwriter ist eine Chrome-Erweiterung, die es KI-Tools ermöglicht, Ihren Browser zu steuern, indem sie Playwright-Snippets in einer stateful Sandbox ausführt O Playwriter é uma extensão do Chrome que permite controlar o navegador com snippets de Playwright em um sandbox estado. Saiba mais sobre como configurá-lo. Playwriter - расширение Chrome, которое позволяет управлять браузером с помощью фрагментов Playwright в состоянии песочницы. Узнайте, как его настроить. Playwriter هو امتداد كروم يسمح بالتحكم في المتصفح باستخدام شفرات Playwright في sandbox حالة. تعلم كيفية إعداده. how to use playwriter playwriter setup guide playwriter alternative playwriter vs puppeteer playwriter install what is playwriter playwriter documentation playwriter tutorial playwriter chrome extension Playwriter AIエージェント 浏览器控制 Playwright stateful sandbox CLI MCP 会话管理 超时配置 Runs Playwright snippets in a stateful sandbox Supports session management and timeout configuration Provides selector strategies and best practices for slow pages and SPAs Includes context variables and utility functions Available as CLI or MCP playwriter is a Chrome extension that enables agents to control browsers using Playwright snippets in a stateful sandbox, available as CLI or MCP.');
