de Configuração do Worktree para Desenvolvimento Par...","ru":"Настройка worktree для параллельной разработки с ИИ Агентами","ar":"دليل إعداد worktree للاستفادة القصوى من التطوير المتوازي ..."},"description":{"en":"Discover how worktree streamlines parallel development with git worktrees and tmux windows. Learn how to launch tasks with workmux and boost your dev workflo...","zh":"使用worktree和tmux窗口实现零摩擦的并行开发，提高开发效率","ja":"git worktreesとtmux windowsを使用して並行開発のフリクションをゼロに","ko":"worktree와 tmux 창을 사용하여 병렬 개발의 마찰을 제거하고 개발 효율성을 향상시키세요","es":"Aprenda a utilizar worktree con git worktrees y tmux windows para una mayor productividad en el desarrollo paralelo","fr":"Découvrez comment utiliser worktree avec git worktrees et tmux windows pour un développement parallèle sans friction","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie worktree mit git worktrees und tmux windows für eine reibungslose parallele Entwicklung nutzen können","pt":"Aprenda a usar o worktree com git worktrees e tmux windows para desenvolvimento paralelo sem atrito","ru":"Узнайте, как использовать worktree с git worktrees и tmux windows для параллельной разработки без проблем","ar":"تعلم كيفية استخدام worktree مع git worktrees و tmux windows لتحقيق تطوير متوازي بدون احتكاك"},"definition":{"en":"worktree is a skill that utilizes git worktrees and tmux windows for zero-friction parallel development, enabling efficient task management with workmux.","zh":"worktree是一种使用git worktrees和tmux窗口的并行开发工具","ja":"worktreeはgit worktreesとtmux windowsを使用する並行開発ツールです","ko":"worktree는 git worktree와 tmux 창을 사용하는 병렬 개발 도구입니다","es":"Worktree es una herramienta que combina git worktrees y tmux windows para un desarrollo paralelo eficiente","fr":"Worktree est un outil qui combine git worktrees et tmux windows pour un développement parallèle efficace","de":"Worktree ist ein Tool, das git worktrees und tmux windows für eine effiziente parallele Entwicklung kombiniert","pt":"O worktree é uma ferramenta que combina git worktrees e tmux windows para desenvolvimento paralelo","ru":"Worktree - это инструмент, который объединяет git worktrees и tmux windows для параллельной разработки","ar":"worktree هو أداة توفر إمكانية الجمع بين git worktrees و tmux windows لتحقيق التطوير المتوازي"},"features":{"en":["Launches tasks in new git worktrees using workmux","Utilizes tmux windows for parallel development","Automates workflow tasks with workmux add command","Enforces a hard rule of not exploring or searching the codebase","Supports writing prompt files for task execution"],"zh":["使用git worktrees实现并行开发","集成tmux窗口管理","零摩擦开发体验","支持多任务并行执行","使用workmux add命令添加任务"],"ja":["git worktreesを使用した並行開発","tmux windowsの統合","ゼロフリクション開発体験","マルチタスクの並行実行","workmux addコマンドを使用したタスクの追加"],"ko":["git worktree를 사용한 병렬 개발","tmux 창 통합","제로 프릭션 개발 体验","다중 태스크 병렬 실행","workmux add 명령을 사용한 태스크 추가"],"es":["Lanzamiento de tareas en nuevos entornos de trabajo de git","Integración con workmux para una mayor productividad","Uso de tmux windows para una mejor organización","Desarrollo paralelo sin fricciones","Compatibilidad con git worktrees"],"fr":["Lancement de tâches dans de nouveaux environnements de travail git","Intégration avec workmux pour une productivité accrue","Utilisation de fenêtres tmux pour une meilleure organisation","Développement parallèle sans friction","Compatibilité avec git worktrees"],"de":["Starten von Tasks in neuen git-Arbeitsbereichen","Integration mit workmux für eine höhere Produktivität","Verwendung von tmux-Fenstern für eine bessere Organisation","Parallele Entwicklung ohne Reibung","Kompatibilität mit git worktrees"],"pt":["Lançamento de tarefas em novos git worktrees","Integração com workmux","Utilização de tmux windows","Desenvolvimento paralelo sem atrito","Compatibilidade com git worktrees"],"ru":["Запуск задач в новых git worktrees","Интеграция с workmux","Использование tmux windows","Параллельная разработка без проблем","Совместимость с git worktrees"],"ar":["إطلاق مهام في git worktrees جديدة","التكامل مع workmux","استخدام tmux windows","التطوير المتوازي بدون احتكاك","التوافق مع git worktrees"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use worktree","worktree alternative","worktree setup guide","git worktrees tutorial","tmux windows for development","workmux command line"],"zh":["worktree","git worktrees","tmux窗口","并行开发","零摩擦开发","workmux","AIエージェント","并行开发工具"],"ja":["worktree","git worktrees","tmux windows","並行開発","ゼロフリクション開発","workmux","AIエージェント","並行開発ツール"],"ko":["worktree","git worktree","tmux 창","병렬 개발","제로 프릭션 개발","workmux","AI 에이전트","병렬 개발 도구"],"es":["worktree","desarrollo paralelo","git worktrees","tmux windows","workmux","herramientas de desarrollo","productividad en el desarrollo","desarrollo de software","git"],"fr":["worktree","développement parallèle","git worktrees","fenêtres tmux","workmux","outils de développement","productivité dans le développement","développement de logiciels","git"],"de":["worktree","parallele Entwicklung","git worktrees","tmux-Fenster","workmux","Entwicklertools","Produktivität in der Entwicklung","Softwareentwicklung","git"],"pt":["worktree","desenvolvimento paralelo","git worktrees","tmux windows","workmux","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","desenvolvimento de software","produtividade de desenvolvedores"],"ru":["worktree","параллельная разработка","git worktrees","tmux windows","workmux","инструменты разработки","разработка программного обеспечения","производительность разработчиков","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["worktree","التطوير المتوازي","git worktrees","tmux windows","workmux","أدوات التطوير","تطوير البرمجيات","إنتاجية المطورين","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"raine","repo":"workmux","repoPath":"raine/workmux","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.274Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"worktree","description":"Launch one or more tasks in new git worktrees using workmux.","bodyPreview":"Launch one or more tasks in new git worktrees using workmux.\n\nTasks: $ARGUMENTS\n\n## You are a dispatcher, not an implementer\n\n**HARD RULE — NO EXCEPTIONS:** Do NOT explore, read, grep, glob, or search the\ncodebase. Do NOT use the Task/Explore agent. Do NOT investigate the problem. You\nare a thin dispatcher — your ONLY job is to write prompt files and run\n`workmux add`. The worktree agent will do all the exploration and implementation.\n\nIf the user''s message contains enough context to write a pro","body":"Launch one or more tasks in new git worktrees using workmux.\n\nTasks: $ARGUMENTS\n\n## You are a dispatcher, not an implementer\n\n**HARD RULE — NO EXCEPTIONS:** Do NOT explore, read, grep, glob, or search the\ncodebase. Do NOT use the Task/Explore agent. Do NOT investigate the problem. You\nare a thin dispatcher — your ONLY job is to write prompt files and run\n`workmux add`. The worktree agent will do all the exploration and implementation.\n\nIf the user''s message contains enough context to write a prompt, write it\nimmediately. If not, ask the user for clarification — do NOT try to figure it\nout by reading code.\n\nIf tasks reference earlier conversation (e.g., \"do option 2\"), include all\nrelevant context in each prompt you write.\n\nIf tasks reference a markdown file (e.g., a plan or spec), re-read the file to\nensure you have the latest version before writing prompts.\n\nFor each task:\n\n1. Generate a short, descriptive worktree name (2-4 words, kebab-case)\n2. Write a detailed implementation prompt to a temp file\n3. Run `workmux add <worktree-name> -b -P <temp-file>` to create the worktree\n\nThe prompt file should:\n\n- Include the full task description\n- Use RELATIVE paths only (never absolute paths, since each worktree has its own\n  root directory)\n- Be specific about what the agent should accomplish\n\n## Skill delegation\n\nIf the user passes a skill reference (e.g., `/auto`, `/plan-review`),\nthe prompt should instruct the agent to use that skill instead of writing out\nmanual implementation steps.\n\n**Skills can have flags.** If the user passes `/auto --gemini`, pass the\nflag through to the skill invocation in the prompt.\n\nExample prompt:\n```\n[Task description here]\n\nUse the skill: /skill-name [flags if any] [task description]\n```\n\nDo NOT write detailed implementation steps when a skill is specified — the skill\nhandles that.\n\n## Flags\n\n**`--merge`**: When passed, add instruction to use `/merge` skill at the end to\ncommit, rebase, and merge the branch.\n\n```\n...\nThen use the /merge skill to commit, rebase, and merge the branch.\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\nWrite ALL temp files first, THEN run all workmux commands.\n\nStep 1 - Write all prompt files (in parallel):\n\n```bash\ntmpfile=$(mktemp).md\ncat > \"$tmpfile\" << ''EOF''\nImplement feature X...\nEOF\necho \"$tmpfile\"  # Note the path for step 2\n```\n\nStep 2 - After ALL files are written, run workmux commands (in parallel):\n\n```bash\nworkmux add feature-x -b -P /tmp/tmp.abc123.md\nworkmux add feature-y -b -P /tmp/tmp.def456.md\n```\n\nAfter creating the worktrees, inform the user which branches were created.\n\n**Remember:** Your task is COMPLETE once worktrees are created. Do NOT implement\nanything yourself.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:36.392Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Development Agents that need to manage parallel coding experiments and feature development.","zh":"适合需要管理并行编码实验和功能开发的AI开发代理。","ja":"並行コーディング実験や機能開発を管理する必要があるAI開発エージェントに最適。","ko":"병렬 코딩 실험 및 기능 개발을 관리해야 하는 AI 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de AI que necesitan gestionar experimentos de codificación paralelos y desarrollo de características.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement d''IA qui ont besoin de gérer des expériences de codage parallèles et le développement de fonctionnalités.","de":"Ideal für AI-Entwicklungsagenten, die parallele Codierexperimente und Funktionsentwicklung verwalten müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de IA que precisam gerenciar experimentos de codificação paralelos e desenvolvimento de recursos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки ИИ, которым необходимо управлять параллельными кодировочными экспериментами и разработкой функций.","ar":"مثالية لعمليات وكيلات التطوير الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى إدارة تجارب برمجة متوازية وتطوير الميزات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to launch isolated development environments in new git worktrees using workmux, automating parallel workflow execution. This provides clean separation for concurrent tasks without disrupting the main repository state.","zh":"允许代理使用workmux在新的git工作树中启动隔离的开发环境，自动执行并行工作流程。这提供了并发任务的干净隔离，不会破坏主存储库状态。","ja":"workmuxを使用して新しいgitワークツリーで分離された開発環境を起動し、並行ワークフローの実行を自動化します。これにより、メインリポジトリの状態を破壊せずに並行タスクのクリーンな分離が提供されます。","ko":"workmux를 사용하여 새 git 작업 트리에서 격리된 개발 환경을 시작하고 병렬 워크플로우의 실행을 자동화합니다. 이렇게 하면 메인 리포지토리의 상태를 방해하지 않고 병렬 작업을 위한 깨끗한 분리가 제공됩니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes iniciar entornos de desarrollo aislados en nuevos worktrees de git utilizando workmux, automatizando la ejecución de flujos de trabajo paralelos. Esto proporciona una separación limpia para tareas concurrentes sin perturbar el estado del repositorio principal.","fr":"Permet aux agents de lancer des environnements de développement isolés dans de nouveaux worktrees git en utilisant workmux, automatisant l''exécution de flux de travail parallèles. Cela fournit une séparation propre pour les tâches concurrentes sans perturber l''état du référentiel principal.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, isolierte Entwicklungsumgebungen in neuen git-Worktrees mit workmux zu starten, automatisiert die parallele Ausführung von Workflows. Dies bietet eine saubere Trennung für gleichzeitige Aufgaben, ohne den Zustand des Hauptrepositories zu stören.","pt":"Permite que os agentes lancem ambientes de desenvolvimento isolados em novos worktrees git usando workmux, automatizando a execução de fluxos de trabalho paralelos. Isso fornece uma separação limpa para tarefas concorrentes sem perturbar o estado do repositório principal.","ru":"Позволяет агентам запускать изолированные среды разработки в новых git-работах с помощью workmux, автоматизируя параллельное выполнение рабочих процессов. Это обеспечивает чистое разделение для параллельных задач без нарушения состояния основного репозитория.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إطلاق بيئات التطوير المعزولة في أشجار العمل الجديدة git باستخدام workmux، وتأتمة تنفيذ سير العمل الموازي. يوفر ذلك فصلًا نظيفًا للمهام المتزامنة دون الإضرار بحالة المستودع الرئيسي."},"useCases":{"en":["Launching parallel coding experiments","Automating feature branch testing","Managing concurrent bug fix implementations","Running isolated dependency upgrades"],"zh":["启动并行编码实验","自动化功能分支测试","管理并发错误修复实现","运行隔离的依赖升级"],"ja":["並行コーディング実験の起動","機能ブランチテストの自動化","並行バグ修正実装の管理","依存関係のアップグレードの実行"],"ko":["병렬 코딩 실험 시작","기능 분기 테스트 자동화","병렬 오류 수정 구현 관리","격리된 종속성 업그레이드 실행"],"es":["Iniciar experimentos de codificación paralelos","Automatizar pruebas de ramas de características","Gestionar implementaciones de correcciones de errores concurrentes","Ejecutar actualizaciones de dependencias aisladas"],"fr":["Lancer des expériences de codage parallèles","Automatiser les tests de branches de fonctionnalités","Gérer les implementations de corrections de bogues concurrentes","Exécuter des mises à jour de dépendances isolées"],"de":["Starten von parallelen Codierexperimenten","Automatisieren von Feature-Branch-Tests","Verwalten von gleichzeitigen Bug-Fix-Implementierungen","Ausführen von isolierten Abhängigkeits-updates"],"pt":["Iniciar experimentos de codificação paralelos","Automatizar testes de branch de recursos","Gerenciar implementações de correção de bugs concorrentes","Executar atualizações de dependência isoladas"],"ru":["Запуск параллельных кодировочных экспериментов","Автоматизация тестирования веток функций","Управление параллельными реализациями исправления ошибок","Выполнение изолированных обновлений зависимостей"],"ar":["تشغيل تجارب برمجة متوازية","تأتمة اختبار الفرع الميزات","إدارة تنفيذ إصلاح العيوب المتزامن","تشغيل تحديثات التبعيات المعزولة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git worktree support","Depends on workmux integration","Acts as dispatcher only (no code exploration)"],"zh":["需要git工作树支持","依赖于workmux集成","仅作为调度器（无代码探索）"],"ja":["gitワークツリーのサポートが必要","workmuxの統合に依存","ディスパッチャーのみ（コードの探索なし）"],"ko":["git 작업 트리 지원이 필요합니다","workmux 통합에 의존합니다","디스패처만 사용(코드 탐색 없음)"],"es":["Requiere soporte de git worktree","Depende de la integración de workmux","Actúa como despachador solo (sin exploración de código)"],"fr":["Nécessite la prise en charge de git worktree","Dépend de l''intégration de workmux","Agit comme dispatcheur uniquement (sans exploration de code)"],"de":["Benötigt Unterstützung für git-Worktree","Hängt von der workmux-Integration ab","Funktioniert nur als Dispatcher (keine Code-Exploration)"],"pt":["Requer suporte a worktree git","Depende da integração do workmux","Atua como despachante apenas (sem exploração de código)"],"ru":["Требует поддержки git-работ","Зависит от интеграции workmux","Действует как диспетчер только (без исследования кода)"],"ar":["يتطلب دعم شجرة العمل git","يعتمد على دمج workmux","يتصرف كمشغل فقط (دون استكشاف الشفرة)"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"222481216adf803430cea1996068fe03f654b27e1ab7d556fc1fdf1b0b4614fa","qualityScore":36}');
